WEBVTT

00:28.600 --> 00:29.160
Your Highness,

00:29.480 --> 00:30.760
is the poison acting up again?

00:34.520 --> 00:35.560
Give me the medicine.

00:36.640 --> 00:37.200
But

00:37.520 --> 00:38.430
Physician Xie said...

00:38.430 --> 00:39.070
Give it to me.

01:02.640 --> 01:03.600
Don't worry.

01:04.784 --> 01:06.140
It will hold me over for a while.

01:10.400 --> 01:11.560
I, as a blade,

01:11.790 --> 01:13.430
swear to protect you to the death.

01:25.710 --> 01:26.480
Remember this.

01:27.824 --> 01:29.840
When facing battle,
do not harbor a death wish.

01:30.920 --> 01:32.400
You must hold onto the will to live.

01:34.280 --> 01:35.350
You are not a blade.

01:36.310 --> 01:37.230
You are my man.

03:04.900 --> 03:05.660
=Blossoms of Power=

03:05.670 --> 03:08.570
(Adapted from the novel, After My
Bloom, All Flowers Wither by Jin Huang)

03:08.580 --> 03:11.540
=Episode 28=

03:32.400 --> 03:32.940
This way.

03:34.990 --> 03:35.630
Careful.

03:44.630 --> 03:45.400
Report!

03:48.150 --> 03:48.840
Report!

03:51.520 --> 03:52.150
Report!

03:53.590 --> 03:54.910
The Le tribe has reached Tingzhou.

03:57.360 --> 03:57.960
Young Master,

03:58.000 --> 03:58.990
there is no time to lose.

03:59.000 --> 04:00.740
We must send reinforcements
to Tingzhou now.

04:00.752 --> 04:02.864
We cannot let the Le tribe
advance any further.

04:03.360 --> 04:04.240
I, Guo Ying,

04:04.240 --> 04:05.560
beseech you for the order

04:05.616 --> 04:07.264
to reinforce Tingzhou immediately.

04:07.710 --> 04:08.190
No,

04:08.800 --> 04:09.470
Uncle Guo.

04:10.240 --> 04:10.840
I will go.

04:11.240 --> 04:11.910
Young Master,

04:11.968 --> 04:13.072
you are severely injured.

04:13.080 --> 04:14.830
It is not suitable for you
to lead troops right now.

04:14.840 --> 04:16.120
The Duke has not yet awakened.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.190
Northwest Army still needs you
to take command.

04:18.430 --> 04:19.390
You cannot go.

04:19.390 --> 04:20.630
Please let me go instead.

04:20.800 --> 04:21.680
I request the order

04:21.680 --> 04:23.360
to go to Tingzhou in your stead.

04:27.040 --> 04:28.630
The Crown Prince has arrived!

04:35.952 --> 04:38.496
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

04:38.950 --> 04:40.040
Please rise, Generals.

04:40.510 --> 04:41.870
There is no Crown Prince here.

04:42.224 --> 04:43.872
Only the son-in-law of the Shen family.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.630
You are severely injured.

04:49.712 --> 04:51.760
It is indeed unsuitable
for you to go to battle.

04:52.032 --> 04:53.600
As the son-in-law of the Shen family,

04:53.760 --> 04:55.552
I am willing to go to war in your stead.

04:55.920 --> 04:56.560
No.

04:56.920 --> 04:57.830
Weapons have no eyes.

04:58.240 --> 04:59.800
If anything were to happen to you,

04:59.800 --> 05:01.296
how could I explain it to His Majesty?

05:01.300 --> 05:03.710
Once the news of the Duke of Wei's
critical condition spreads,

05:03.720 --> 05:05.584
the foreign tribes will surely
make their move.

05:05.728 --> 05:07.696
The Le tribe is only the enemy
in front of us.

05:07.712 --> 05:09.950
If the foreign tribes learn
that northwest is leaderless,

05:09.950 --> 05:10.770
and take advantage of it,

05:10.784 --> 05:13.120
it will only put us
at a greater disadvantage in this war.

05:13.430 --> 05:14.680
Your primary duty

05:14.830 --> 05:16.390
is to be the backbone of northwest.

05:17.560 --> 05:18.830
But Your Highness...

05:18.830 --> 05:19.920
The matters you worry about,

05:20.270 --> 05:21.190
you can rest assured.

05:21.616 --> 05:24.160
The people of northwest
are also subjects of Daxing.

05:24.560 --> 05:25.504
If I stay out of this,

05:25.510 --> 05:27.720
how can I be fit to sit on the throne
of the Crown Prince?

05:29.190 --> 05:30.000
Please, Young Master,

05:30.080 --> 05:31.360
grant me the military seal.

05:39.800 --> 05:41.480
None of you has seen His Highness?

05:42.190 --> 05:44.480
We haven't seen His Highness
since early morning.

05:49.568 --> 05:51.040
Where did the Crown Prince go?

05:51.390 --> 05:52.720
His Highness left at dawn,

05:52.720 --> 05:54.064
leading troops to Tingzhou City.

05:54.432 --> 05:55.120
Prepare my horse.

05:55.152 --> 05:56.920
Dispatch all the personal guards
in the manor.

05:56.920 --> 05:58.190
Follow me to Tingzhou City.

05:58.190 --> 06:00.360
- Your Highness!
- Your Highness!

06:32.920 --> 06:35.700
Charge!

06:35.700 --> 06:43.160
- Charge!
- Charge!

06:48.750 --> 06:50.950
Charge!

07:06.510 --> 07:07.510
Changtai?

07:08.800 --> 07:10.390
You are the one behind Geng Liangcheng.

07:11.720 --> 07:12.310
Huayong,

07:13.070 --> 07:15.040
you've been acting sickly,
deceiving everyone.

07:15.616 --> 07:17.120
Did you think you were the only one

07:17.680 --> 07:19.000
who could turn their face

07:19.480 --> 07:20.800
into a mask?

07:21.160 --> 07:22.720
You actually committed treason.

07:23.560 --> 07:24.260
Have you forgotten

07:24.270 --> 07:26.680
the humiliation when the Le tribe
trampled the Central Plains?

07:26.690 --> 07:29.310
Xiao Changtai, you are unworthy of being
a son of the Xiao family!

07:29.310 --> 07:30.000
Shut up!

07:32.270 --> 07:33.240
When I win,

07:33.600 --> 07:34.480
history

07:34.950 --> 07:36.600
will be written by me.

07:36.680 --> 07:37.630
Die!

07:57.430 --> 07:58.120
Report!

07:58.176 --> 08:01.248
The Yaozhou garrison broke through the
mountain pass defense and is attacking!

08:01.720 --> 08:02.800
Yaozhou garrison?

08:03.680 --> 08:04.600
Who is leading them?

08:04.600 --> 08:06.430
It's Prince Xin, Xiao Changqing.

08:13.560 --> 08:15.190
Soldiers, hear my command!

08:15.270 --> 08:16.160
- Yes!
- Yes!

08:16.560 --> 08:19.000
Attack!

08:19.390 --> 08:20.390
Charge!

08:20.390 --> 08:23.600
- Kill!
- Kill!

09:04.600 --> 09:06.670
- Kill!
- Kill!

10:14.080 --> 10:14.630
Your Highness,

10:14.840 --> 10:15.630
the battle is lost.

10:15.840 --> 10:16.600
We must retreat!

10:20.630 --> 10:21.240
Go!

10:21.910 --> 10:22.960
Retreat!

10:42.470 --> 10:44.710
♪A wall that collapses at a single push♪

10:46.040 --> 10:48.290
♪Frost that melts at a single smile♪

10:49.610 --> 10:54.890
♪How can you be this wonderful♪

10:55.670 --> 10:56.550
Why are you here?

10:56.820 --> 10:59.760
♪I've hidden so many words♪

11:00.080 --> 11:01.720
If you dare to act on your own again,

11:01.776 --> 11:03.088
I won't let you off lightly.

11:04.270 --> 11:05.030
Yes, my princess.

11:05.040 --> 11:11.020
♪So never uncover♪

11:11.210 --> 11:13.910
♪Wind that misses the grasp♪

11:14.820 --> 11:17.290
♪Light that ignites at a single touch♪

11:18.320 --> 11:23.400
♪A person can find strength
time and again♪

11:25.590 --> 11:28.330
♪Our past♪

11:29.050 --> 11:31.320
♪Has been full of ups and downs
along the way♪

11:31.320 --> 11:32.368
It's so good to have you.

11:32.740 --> 11:34.350
♪Admitting my confusion♪

11:34.350 --> 11:36.290
♪Just like your regret♪

11:36.290 --> 11:39.930
♪How hard can it be?♪

11:42.580 --> 11:46.170
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

11:47.090 --> 11:49.720
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

11:50.590 --> 11:55.740
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

11:55.760 --> 12:02.750
- We won!
- We won!

12:04.430 --> 12:08.400
♪So please try your best
to be open first♪

12:08.550 --> 12:09.320
Let's go home!

12:09.960 --> 12:10.790
Let's go home!

12:11.550 --> 12:14.080
- We're going home!
- Let's go home!

12:14.080 --> 12:15.790
Nice!

12:16.140 --> 12:19.460
(Shen)

12:19.460 --> 12:22.780
(Tingzhou)

12:22.780 --> 12:28.720
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

12:30.240 --> 12:35.540
♪The flustered mortal world♪

12:35.540 --> 12:37.300
- We won!
- We won!

12:37.300 --> 12:43.340
♪Your eyes remain clear and bright♪

13:00.510 --> 13:01.630
For the next few days,

13:01.870 --> 13:03.720
you must be very careful, Your Highness.

13:04.200 --> 13:05.750
Don't let the wound get wet.

13:07.670 --> 13:09.000
Get out, all of you.

13:34.080 --> 13:34.630
Report!

13:36.240 --> 13:36.840
Your Highness,

13:36.912 --> 13:38.464
the Princess Consort wishes to see you.

13:40.660 --> 13:43.020
(Willows Reflected
in the Meandering Stream)

14:33.720 --> 14:34.510
You're back.

14:41.550 --> 14:42.150
Come sit.

14:59.870 --> 15:01.360
I cooked myself

15:01.360 --> 15:02.910
and made some of your favorite dishes.

15:05.390 --> 15:06.080
Yanyan,

15:07.600 --> 15:08.720
you look beautiful today.

15:09.670 --> 15:11.360
Just like the day of our grand wedding,

15:12.120 --> 15:13.440
when you first married me.

15:21.630 --> 15:22.120
Come,

15:23.360 --> 15:24.080
have a taste.

15:33.320 --> 15:34.870
You don't think

15:35.200 --> 15:36.510
that seeing you defeated,

15:37.000 --> 15:38.600
I'd kill you to claim credit, do you?

15:50.630 --> 15:52.200
How could I ever doubt you?

15:53.510 --> 15:55.080
I just don't trust anyone else.

16:07.360 --> 16:09.000
Given our current situation,

16:10.080 --> 16:11.670
if someone wanted us dead,

16:12.550 --> 16:14.150
why would they even bother with poison?

16:22.550 --> 16:23.200
Yanyan,

16:25.072 --> 16:27.072
you should go back
to the imperial capital.

16:27.960 --> 16:28.870
Right now,

16:29.960 --> 16:31.390
I have nowhere left to run.

16:32.030 --> 16:33.240
But you're different.

16:34.336 --> 16:37.000
Everyone knows you were confined
to the manor by His Majesty.

16:38.270 --> 16:39.840
No one knows you came to northwest.

16:40.910 --> 16:42.320
Everything I've done

16:42.910 --> 16:44.120
has nothing to do with you.

16:50.320 --> 16:51.480
I can't go back.

16:54.480 --> 16:55.670
Making the wrong choice

17:00.670 --> 17:01.790
leads to a path of no return.

17:05.350 --> 17:06.200
Yanyan.

17:13.680 --> 17:15.160
I never wanted you to fight

17:15.344 --> 17:17.360
for that dragon throne
in Mingzheng Hall.

17:18.720 --> 17:19.920
In your eyes,

17:20.350 --> 17:22.070
it's the path
to supreme imperial power.

17:25.680 --> 17:27.070
But in mine,

17:28.590 --> 17:30.480
it's a deep grave
leading to the underworld.

18:00.400 --> 18:00.920
Yanyan,

18:02.270 --> 18:03.310
what are you doing?

18:09.240 --> 18:10.270
I'm truly tired.

18:12.270 --> 18:13.400
All these years,

18:14.350 --> 18:15.960
in front of everyone,

18:17.000 --> 18:18.960
you acted like
you were madly in love with me.

18:20.880 --> 18:23.480
But I was always just
a knife in your hand,

18:24.590 --> 18:26.270
a mask you wore in public.

18:29.270 --> 18:30.640
I'm truly tired of it.

18:32.550 --> 18:33.270
Yanyan,

18:33.510 --> 18:34.030
don't.

18:34.160 --> 18:34.720
Yanyan!

18:35.550 --> 18:36.110
Don't!

18:36.110 --> 18:38.820
♪Time is like a river flowing backward♪

18:38.820 --> 18:41.450
♪The story is sketched anew♪

18:41.510 --> 18:43.030
No!

18:46.460 --> 18:49.220
♪The tide engulfs the lines on my palm♪

18:49.220 --> 18:51.940
♪Pushing me to converge with you♪

18:51.940 --> 18:56.420
♪Sifting for joy in a sea of sorrow♪

18:57.060 --> 18:59.260
♪I step onto this winding path♪

18:59.310 --> 19:00.030
Yanyan.

19:00.060 --> 19:02.060
♪What was swept away?♪

19:02.260 --> 19:06.420
♪Joy and sorrow show no emotion♪

19:07.510 --> 19:08.960
I only hope in the next life,

19:11.440 --> 19:12.960
we'll never meet again.

19:12.980 --> 19:17.540
♪Only to find it's just a bubble♪

19:18.790 --> 19:21.060
♪Scene after scene of yesterday♪

19:21.060 --> 19:23.930
♪Lies between the sky and the water♪

19:23.930 --> 19:26.300
♪The stars are sinking♪

19:26.300 --> 19:29.300
♪Like a sunken vow♪

19:29.790 --> 19:32.470
♪You drifted away alone♪

19:33.100 --> 19:37.540
♪Without a single word of goodbye♪

19:38.410 --> 19:41.020
♪Leaving no room to turn back♪

19:41.020 --> 19:45.290
♪I can only stay there forever♪

19:45.290 --> 19:50.520
♪In the coming years, I'll always
remember that year, my graceful lover♪

19:50.720 --> 19:52.930
♪Love hangs on the crest of the waves♪

19:53.360 --> 19:57.330
♪Waiting for regret to swallow me up♪

20:11.380 --> 20:18.380
(Half a Month Later)

20:25.920 --> 20:26.880
Charge!

20:28.790 --> 20:29.480
Charge!

20:33.960 --> 20:35.000
General Shitou,

20:35.680 --> 20:37.440
flank the enemy from behind!

20:42.110 --> 20:43.270
General Xiaoniu,

20:43.880 --> 20:45.110
the enemy has been repelled.

20:45.510 --> 20:47.110
We must press our advantage!

20:53.640 --> 20:55.240
My shoulder's been hit!

20:55.240 --> 20:56.070
I'm still alive.

20:56.070 --> 20:57.310
I can still fight!

20:58.830 --> 20:59.480
Good!

21:00.030 --> 21:01.510
Spoken like a true soldier.

21:04.270 --> 21:04.960
Charge!

21:06.830 --> 21:07.680
Father.

21:08.544 --> 21:10.220
You haven't recovered
from your injuries.

21:10.240 --> 21:11.552
Why are you out here again?

21:13.240 --> 21:14.640
You know your father.

21:15.030 --> 21:17.310
I just can't sit still.

21:19.480 --> 21:21.680
If you focus on recovering,

21:21.880 --> 21:24.270
I'll cook something special
to reward you tonight.

21:24.640 --> 21:25.480
I'll listen to you.

21:26.590 --> 21:28.070
I'll do whatever you say.

21:29.830 --> 21:33.550
As they say, military orders
on the battlefield are absolute.

21:33.790 --> 21:34.640
But at home...

21:35.440 --> 21:37.472
What do you say, my good son-in-law?

21:39.856 --> 21:41.632
Youyou is in charge of everything.

21:42.680 --> 21:44.480
Well said.

21:51.160 --> 21:51.920
Youyou,

21:52.310 --> 21:53.920
your cooking has improved again.

21:54.200 --> 21:55.030
It's very flavorful.

21:55.240 --> 21:56.110
Then eat some more.

21:56.480 --> 21:57.070
Okay.

22:08.550 --> 22:09.310
Father-in-law,

22:09.328 --> 22:11.344
this is freshly grilled.
Please, have a taste.

22:11.830 --> 22:12.880
Grilled by you?

22:13.030 --> 22:13.440
Yes.

22:14.160 --> 22:15.550
I absolutely cannot accept this.

22:15.640 --> 22:17.650
There is a distinction
between ruler and subject.

22:17.664 --> 22:19.110
I am not worthy.

22:21.110 --> 22:21.790
Father-in-law,

22:21.792 --> 22:23.780
the day I first entered
northwest's military camp,

22:23.790 --> 22:25.720
I told the generals and Yun'an

22:25.744 --> 22:27.170
that there is no Crown Prince here,

22:27.296 --> 22:28.736
only the Shen family's son-in-law.

22:28.784 --> 22:30.496
That is even more true today.

22:36.160 --> 22:37.000
All right.

22:37.200 --> 22:38.110
Then

22:38.310 --> 22:39.510
thank you, my good son-in-law.

22:48.790 --> 22:49.270
Come.

22:57.480 --> 22:58.830
In the battle of Tingzhou,

22:59.240 --> 23:00.790
you protected our territory

23:01.160 --> 23:02.680
and executed the traitor.

23:03.270 --> 23:04.480
Tonight, you and I

23:05.070 --> 23:06.240
must have a few more drinks.

23:08.160 --> 23:09.510
Since you're in high spirits,

23:09.792 --> 23:11.310
I will certainly keep you company.

23:11.830 --> 23:13.160
But you're still injured,

23:13.200 --> 23:14.880
so please remember
to drink in moderation.

23:14.880 --> 23:16.480
All right.

23:17.070 --> 23:18.200
I'll listen to both of you.

23:28.880 --> 23:29.920
What is this?

23:30.240 --> 23:31.110
It smells so good.

23:31.510 --> 23:33.400
I don't think
I've ever smelled it before.

23:34.368 --> 23:37.290
This incense is made by pouring strong
liquor over it and burning it dry.

23:37.480 --> 23:39.880
Once lit, the aroma
of the liquor is intoxicating.

23:39.880 --> 23:41.120
It's just like drinking alcohol,

23:41.400 --> 23:42.550
but it doesn't harm the body.

23:42.592 --> 23:44.480
And there's no hangover
when you wake up.

23:46.750 --> 23:47.400
Right.

23:47.920 --> 23:50.030
I'm already feeling a bit dizzy.

23:50.110 --> 23:50.920
It feels like

23:51.830 --> 23:53.880
I've drunk several jugs of liquor.

23:55.790 --> 23:56.240
Here.

23:57.200 --> 23:57.750
Okay.

24:36.960 --> 24:38.480
Since you're so worried about Father,

24:39.400 --> 24:40.960
why didn't you stop him from drinking?

24:41.750 --> 24:42.720
Father is happy.

24:43.160 --> 24:44.310
Let him drink if he wants to.

24:45.160 --> 24:46.550
I just need to find a way

24:46.960 --> 24:49.110
to minimize the harm.

24:51.160 --> 24:52.000
Why are you smiling?

24:53.920 --> 24:55.440
I find that sometimes you

24:56.110 --> 24:57.000
understand everything,

24:57.640 --> 24:58.680
and see through everything.

25:00.590 --> 25:01.720
In the past,

25:01.920 --> 25:04.110
I never paid much attention
to matters of the heart.

25:04.750 --> 25:05.590
But from now on,

25:06.400 --> 25:07.590
I will devote my heart to you.

25:20.000 --> 25:21.310
Let's take Father back first.

25:22.510 --> 25:23.350
And then,

25:24.240 --> 25:25.480
I want to take you somewhere.

25:27.160 --> 25:27.920
Now?

25:39.110 --> 25:40.160
From this spot,

25:40.160 --> 25:41.590
the view of the stars is excellent.

25:42.240 --> 25:43.790
They seem so close,

25:43.824 --> 25:45.680
as if you could pluck them from the sky.

25:47.960 --> 25:49.070
The beauty of the night sky

25:50.240 --> 25:51.350
is ever-changing.

25:52.640 --> 25:53.720
Watching it alone

25:54.310 --> 25:55.440
and watching it together

25:55.744 --> 25:57.136
are completely different.

25:57.790 --> 25:58.790
It is indeed different.

26:00.480 --> 26:02.830
I've seen countless night skies,

26:03.110 --> 26:04.510
but never once

26:05.000 --> 26:07.310
have I been this close to the stars.

26:37.880 --> 26:39.030
Here is a

26:40.440 --> 26:41.550
closer heart,

26:42.550 --> 26:43.790
right in your hands.

26:50.110 --> 26:51.240
I accept

26:51.960 --> 26:52.790
this heart.

26:54.070 --> 26:55.510
I will surely cherish it.

26:56.240 --> 26:58.240
From our youth to our old age,

26:58.830 --> 26:59.750
we will never part.

27:13.070 --> 27:14.200
I have something

27:14.590 --> 27:15.510
I want to give you.

27:17.640 --> 27:18.440
What is it?

27:53.270 --> 27:54.270
Are these...

27:54.270 --> 27:56.940
(Name List)

27:57.070 --> 27:59.000
all your trusted officials in the court?

27:59.536 --> 28:01.728
I've painstakingly cultivated them
for years.

28:02.030 --> 28:03.920
Finally, I have some
useful subordinates.

28:04.310 --> 28:05.590
They are all on this list.

28:06.200 --> 28:07.590
To you, these

28:08.200 --> 28:09.750
are crucial secrets.

28:10.110 --> 28:11.480
It's everything you have.

28:12.510 --> 28:13.750
And you're giving it all to me?

28:13.920 --> 28:15.680
We are husband and wife, of one mind.

28:16.550 --> 28:17.590
What is mine

28:18.070 --> 28:19.310
naturally belongs to you too.

28:23.350 --> 28:24.480
Actually, I've been

28:25.152 --> 28:27.160
looking for a chance
to give this list to you.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.480
Now that the situation is settled,

28:30.310 --> 28:31.160
in the court,

28:31.232 --> 28:34.080
you have your grandfather
and the Cui family for civil affairs,

28:34.384 --> 28:37.200
and the Duke of Wei and the
Marquis of Shunan for military affairs.

28:38.240 --> 28:39.750
You also manage the inner palace.

28:40.310 --> 28:41.550
The people on this list

28:42.640 --> 28:43.790
are all reliable.

28:44.440 --> 28:46.400
They can be of help to you
in the future.

28:49.640 --> 28:51.200
You've planned so thoroughly for me,

28:53.270 --> 28:55.750
arranging every step for me.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.720
It's you who took every step

28:58.110 --> 28:59.200
steadily.

28:59.880 --> 29:01.310
I merely assisted from the sidelines.

29:01.952 --> 29:04.310
I was the one who pulled you
into this worldly chaos.

29:04.640 --> 29:05.350
Now,

29:06.070 --> 29:07.680
I just want to make it up to you more.

29:21.400 --> 29:22.480
Today, since we are

29:22.560 --> 29:24.160
being honest with each other,

29:25.200 --> 29:26.000
then...

29:26.240 --> 29:27.830
I will tell you something, too.

29:30.350 --> 29:31.510
Do you remember

29:32.440 --> 29:33.480
when Prince Xin

29:34.510 --> 29:36.160
called me Gu Qingzhi?

29:37.530 --> 29:40.570
♪Pushing the sea of stars
to flow across♪

29:40.790 --> 29:41.750
So,

29:42.110 --> 29:44.590
do you believe what he said?

29:44.590 --> 29:46.960
♪In an endless cycle♪

29:49.440 --> 29:50.200
Xihe...

29:50.200 --> 29:52.740
♪Soft voices in the moonlight♪

29:52.880 --> 29:54.070
I am deeply in love with you.

29:57.240 --> 29:58.880
I want to be bound to you in marriage

30:00.096 --> 30:02.112
and spend the rest of my life with you.

30:03.880 --> 30:04.830
The one I love

30:05.472 --> 30:07.680
is Shen Xihe, the person
standing right in front of me.

30:07.888 --> 30:09.400
Not Commandery Princess Zhaoning.

30:09.600 --> 30:11.760
Not the beloved daughter
of the Duke of Wei.

30:12.270 --> 30:13.750
Nor anyone else.

30:14.640 --> 30:15.480
Just you.

30:15.870 --> 30:19.710
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

30:20.650 --> 30:23.490
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

30:23.890 --> 30:27.500
♪Are gently gathered
into your elegant sleeves♪

30:28.610 --> 30:31.370
♪Gradually, on the misty path♪

30:31.870 --> 30:35.670
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

30:49.440 --> 30:50.590
I once promised you

30:50.944 --> 30:52.160
that if there ever came a day

30:52.608 --> 30:53.830
when I fell in love with you,

30:54.790 --> 30:56.310
I would tell you immediately.

30:57.730 --> 31:00.640
♪People come and go♪

31:01.590 --> 31:02.640
Xiao Huayong,

31:05.480 --> 31:06.680
I love you.

31:09.140 --> 31:12.490
♪When I gaze upon you♪

31:13.040 --> 31:16.400
♪Our destiny is beyond anyone's control♪

31:16.980 --> 31:18.680
♪Everything♪

31:19.160 --> 31:24.090
♪Is past the point of no return♪

31:24.660 --> 31:27.550
♪The timeless wind and moon♪

31:27.810 --> 31:31.710
♪Quietly reflect in your sparkling eyes♪

31:32.720 --> 31:35.490
♪Scattered red petals fall like rain♪

31:35.920 --> 31:40.270
♪It's a wonderful time in the world♪

31:40.690 --> 31:43.520
♪Bits of worries and sorrows♪

31:43.920 --> 31:47.780
♪Are gently gathered
into your elegant sleeves♪

31:48.700 --> 31:51.540
♪Gradually, on the misty path♪

31:51.870 --> 31:56.340
♪Not a trace of sorrow can be found♪

31:57.750 --> 32:01.420
♪I once said all my goodbyes
in a past life♪

32:01.420 --> 32:03.870
♪Weeping silently♪

32:05.900 --> 32:14.300
♪I will hold you in this lifetime
until the very end♪

32:37.270 --> 32:38.000
Father,

32:38.400 --> 32:39.550
after I go back,

32:39.790 --> 32:42.110
please don't delay
taking your daily medicine.

32:44.720 --> 32:45.680
Youyou,

32:46.070 --> 32:47.590
with such a long distance between us,

32:48.030 --> 32:50.590
I don't know when I'll be able
to see you again.

32:53.640 --> 32:55.400
Father, Yun'an, please don't worry.

32:55.920 --> 32:57.160
After I return to the capital,

32:57.616 --> 32:59.520
I will personally ask His Majesty
for a favor.

32:59.790 --> 33:00.880
My father often says,

33:01.720 --> 33:03.750
the royal family also
values family bonds.

33:03.792 --> 33:06.576
He will surely grant permission
for a visit at the end of the year.

33:08.350 --> 33:09.680
Having such a good son-in-law,

33:09.984 --> 33:11.520
what do I have to worry about?

33:12.976 --> 33:14.350
Take good care of yourselves

33:14.448 --> 33:15.720
and look after each other.

33:28.200 --> 33:30.790
- Thank you, Your Highness!
- Thank you, Your Highness!

33:30.848 --> 33:33.136
- Thank you, Your Highness!
- Thank you, Your Highness!

33:40.240 --> 33:41.160
Please take it.

33:41.880 --> 33:42.880
Please take it.

33:43.000 --> 33:43.880
Please take it.

33:44.200 --> 33:44.750
Thank you.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.510
Thank you, Your Highness!

33:48.960 --> 33:50.200
Thank you, Your Highness!

33:50.224 --> 33:53.510
- Thank you, Your Highness!
- Thank you, Your Highness!

33:53.640 --> 33:55.110
Thank you, Your Highness!

34:14.550 --> 34:15.280
Stop the carriage.

34:26.510 --> 34:30.110
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

34:30.192 --> 34:32.016
Please, everyone,
no need for formalities.

34:34.280 --> 34:35.550
Bringing blessings to the people

34:36.150 --> 34:38.070
is truly the duty of my wife and me.

34:39.070 --> 34:39.670
Great.

34:40.512 --> 34:41.400
That's wonderful.

34:41.400 --> 34:42.070
Excellent.

34:45.030 --> 34:47.760
I only hope that northwest
will have favorable weather,

34:48.150 --> 34:49.320
and remain peaceful and safe.

34:49.424 --> 34:51.660
May our nation prosper
and our people live in peace.

34:51.670 --> 34:53.880
- Well said!
- Well said!

34:57.190 --> 34:58.510
Peace and prosperity!

34:59.510 --> 35:01.510
- Well said!
- Well said!

35:18.560 --> 35:20.992
- Greetings, Your Highness.
- Greetings, Your Highness.

35:32.590 --> 35:33.880
Greetings, Your Highness.

35:34.230 --> 35:35.320
Greetings, Crown Princess.

35:44.000 --> 35:44.550
Changqing.

35:45.728 --> 35:46.920
For the battle of Tingzhou,

35:46.992 --> 35:48.720
I haven't had the chance to thank you.

35:48.760 --> 35:49.780
No need for formalities.

35:50.630 --> 35:52.320
I receive a salary and enjoy a fief.

35:52.784 --> 35:54.640
It's my duty
to share the court's burdens.

35:56.510 --> 35:57.150
Then,

35:58.096 --> 35:59.808
is there something you need?

36:02.590 --> 36:03.670
You are weak

36:03.670 --> 36:05.056
and shouldn't be traveling so much.

36:05.360 --> 36:07.550
Now, you've fought on the battlefield
for the people

36:07.960 --> 36:08.840
and even got injured.

36:09.440 --> 36:11.710
I volunteered

36:11.824 --> 36:14.480
to escort you and the Crown Princess
back to the imperial capital.

36:19.872 --> 36:21.190
Since we're going the same way,

36:21.800 --> 36:22.590
I'll trouble you.

36:57.550 --> 36:58.710
Could you

36:59.670 --> 37:00.440
feed me?

37:00.816 --> 37:02.070
You want me to feed you?

37:04.440 --> 37:05.840
Just like usual.

37:14.480 --> 37:16.000
Here, I will feed you.

37:17.110 --> 37:18.110
No need to trouble you.

37:19.248 --> 37:21.300
An older brother taking care
of his younger brother

37:21.312 --> 37:22.176
is perfectly natural,

37:22.960 --> 37:23.550
isn't it?

37:32.190 --> 37:32.670
Here.

37:33.360 --> 37:34.000
Open up.

37:52.110 --> 37:52.800
Is it good?

37:54.920 --> 37:55.630
Not bad.

38:02.400 --> 38:03.760
By taking action this time,

38:04.440 --> 38:05.550
your martial arts skills

38:06.670 --> 38:07.760
are pretty much exposed.

38:12.150 --> 38:13.110
So what?

38:16.416 --> 38:18.630
Aren't you afraid word of this
will reach the court?

38:20.030 --> 38:21.480
And your years of feigning illness

38:22.030 --> 38:23.110
will all be for nothing?

38:25.904 --> 38:28.176
If I can't protect the army
and people of northwest,

38:29.320 --> 38:30.670
or my closest loved ones,

38:30.976 --> 38:33.072
no matter how well I hide my true self,

38:33.190 --> 38:34.070
what's the point?

38:54.320 --> 38:55.510
Me feeding you wontons

38:56.360 --> 38:57.360
is just this once.

38:59.280 --> 39:00.110
Thank you, Changqing.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.360
Stop messing around.

39:22.510 --> 39:23.480
I thought

39:23.710 --> 39:25.190
I made myself clear enough.

39:25.248 --> 39:26.110
Changqing, watch out!

39:27.840 --> 39:29.440
Please help me bandage this.

39:30.070 --> 39:31.230
It hurts, Changqing.

39:31.710 --> 39:33.880
Do you believe I'll kill you
with a knife right now?

39:33.880 --> 39:34.840
I do.

39:35.030 --> 39:36.070
But right now,

39:36.150 --> 39:37.392
you don't have a knife.

39:41.710 --> 39:44.650
♪I've hidden so many words♪

39:45.270 --> 39:48.070
♪Too reluctant to tell you♪

39:48.940 --> 39:55.910
♪So never uncover♪

39:56.100 --> 39:58.460
♪The sand that slips away
with one grasp♪

39:59.590 --> 40:02.320
♪The flower that withers
after one bloom♪

40:03.280 --> 40:08.620
♪Silently buried deep inside my heart♪

40:10.380 --> 40:13.200
♪Every answer I gave♪

40:14.000 --> 40:16.850
♪Was both bittersweet and absurd♪

40:17.640 --> 40:21.010
♪Hiding my tear-filled eyes
when I hurt you♪

40:21.270 --> 40:24.580
♪How hard it truly was?♪

40:27.550 --> 40:30.990
♪The wounds that healed
with just a little comfort♪

40:31.980 --> 40:34.310
♪The lies made whole
with a single embrace♪

40:35.580 --> 40:41.340
♪Pretending to be brave
as if I'd never been hurt♪

40:42.750 --> 40:45.880
♪It's a shame I never could♪

40:46.330 --> 40:49.340
♪Give you a moon in return♪

40:49.450 --> 40:56.090
♪With the same open heart you loved me♪

40:56.090 --> 40:59.760
♪I've crossed the wasteland of memories♪

41:00.630 --> 41:03.390
♪Never knowing I was lost♪

41:03.830 --> 41:06.960
♪Why don't you take me away?♪

41:07.400 --> 41:13.350
♪Lead me out of this endless game
of hide-and-seek♪

41:14.750 --> 41:18.300
♪You'll never♪

41:18.580 --> 41:28.050
♪Know how much I long to, long to♪

41:54.220 --> 41:57.700
(No animals were harmed
in the making of this film)
